{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tumbles (Previously Silk Soar) is a Physics Flinging, Rage Bringing Narrative 2D Platformer (Foddian), where you take on life as a newborn caterpillar attempting to meet the challenges of flinging yourself from the rainforest floor to the top of the canopy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/df3a73dedec32888b86de45348c79f51.poster.avif?t=1762863522\" width=572 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/df3a73dedec32888b86de45348c79f51.webm?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/df3a73dedec32888b86de45348c79f51.mp4?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/93d755e131a7b11e87278d351f474a35.poster.avif?t=1762863522\" width=617 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/93d755e131a7b11e87278d351f474a35.webm?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch your caterpillar around using a catapult-like motion to bounce off walls and flowers, be pushed by the wind, slide across wet leaves and avoid obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/094a3b13f17998011df170e9ad2b8e11.poster.avif?t=1762863522\" width=572 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/094a3b13f17998011df170e9ad2b8e11.webm?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/094a3b13f17998011df170e9ad2b8e11.mp4?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/aefde95bc7444ddd48ff129d4c5c72a6.avif?t=1762863522\" width=617 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you reach higher into the canopy you will face more difficult jumps and a variety of obstacles to go further through the layers of the rainforest in search of the top of the canopy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/7c1caed6f2f61d9123a3f0ea6677f034.poster.avif?t=1762863522\" width=572 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/7c1caed6f2f61d9123a3f0ea6677f034.webm?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/7c1caed6f2f61d9123a3f0ea6677f034.mp4?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/4b18d9aa91e64ff89c8f84a17b23e37c.poster.avif?t=1762863522\" width=617 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/4b18d9aa91e64ff89c8f84a17b23e37c.webm?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the poetic narrative of the struggles of reaching from the depths of darkness in search of freedom and light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/433a5a1e5d70137fa607bd3254ce1032.poster.avif?t=1762863522\" width=572 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/433a5a1e5d70137fa607bd3254ce1032.webm?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/433a5a1e5d70137fa607bd3254ce1032.mp4?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/533dcd6c19d2b5d578c5aabccc166d7c.poster.avif?t=1762863522\" width=617 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/533dcd6c19d2b5d578c5aabccc166d7c.webm?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you choose to build your cocoon there is an increasing chance of evolutions affecting your next caterpillar. Will you be a different colour, have a more bouncy body, or have tunnel vision? What combinations will you have and will they help or hinder your next climb?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tumbles, every climb can bring you further through the climb you have faced before or challenge you with a combination of evolutions. Will you make it out from the forest floor and into the light or will this climb be cut short as another cocoon in the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to freedom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3277320?t=1762863522","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/05fef6b138b82ae8c6f4c0a16bd5f42b4a1fe7a4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762863522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/aca8c3984a70ec8f5a85bb23d4b4c47019fa184e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762863522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/aca8c3984a70ec8f5a85bb23d4b4c47019fa184e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762863522","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3527160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tumbles (Previously Silk Soar) is a Physics Flinging, Rage Bringing Narrative 2D Platformer (Foddian), where you take on life as a newborn caterpillar attempting to meet the challenges of flinging yourself from the rainforest floor to the top of the canopy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/df3a73dedec32888b86de45348c79f51.poster.avif?t=1762863522\" width=572 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/df3a73dedec32888b86de45348c79f51.webm?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/df3a73dedec32888b86de45348c79f51.mp4?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/93d755e131a7b11e87278d351f474a35.poster.avif?t=1762863522\" width=617 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/93d755e131a7b11e87278d351f474a35.webm?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch your caterpillar around using a catapult-like motion to bounce off walls and flowers, be pushed by the wind, slide across wet leaves and avoid obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/094a3b13f17998011df170e9ad2b8e11.poster.avif?t=1762863522\" width=572 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/094a3b13f17998011df170e9ad2b8e11.webm?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/094a3b13f17998011df170e9ad2b8e11.mp4?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/aefde95bc7444ddd48ff129d4c5c72a6.avif?t=1762863522\" width=617 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you reach higher into the canopy you will face more difficult jumps and a variety of obstacles to go further through the layers of the rainforest in search of the top of the canopy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/7c1caed6f2f61d9123a3f0ea6677f034.poster.avif?t=1762863522\" width=572 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/7c1caed6f2f61d9123a3f0ea6677f034.webm?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/7c1caed6f2f61d9123a3f0ea6677f034.mp4?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/4b18d9aa91e64ff89c8f84a17b23e37c.poster.avif?t=1762863522\" width=617 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/4b18d9aa91e64ff89c8f84a17b23e37c.webm?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the poetic narrative of the struggles of reaching from the depths of darkness in search of freedom and light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/433a5a1e5d70137fa607bd3254ce1032.poster.avif?t=1762863522\" width=572 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/433a5a1e5d70137fa607bd3254ce1032.webm?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/433a5a1e5d70137fa607bd3254ce1032.mp4?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/533dcd6c19d2b5d578c5aabccc166d7c.poster.avif?t=1762863522\" width=617 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/533dcd6c19d2b5d578c5aabccc166d7c.webm?t=1762863522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you choose to build your cocoon there is an increasing chance of evolutions affecting your next caterpillar. Will you be a different colour, have a more bouncy body, or have tunnel vision? What combinations will you have and will they help or hinder your next climb?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tumbles, every climb can bring you further through the climb you have faced before or challenge you with a combination of evolutions. Will you make it out from the forest floor and into the light or will this climb be cut short as another cocoon in the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to freedom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Devony Boskell","Stout Heart Games","Sarah Elliott"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/375b90b42dc6c7d650b67c5e651c3793fb9b19bf/header.jpg?t=1762863522","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3277320/850865/ec729432ddd8f9182c8a04b051950b47ec835f7f/1750975259/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743639910","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3277320/850865/ec729432ddd8f9182c8a04b051950b47ec835f7f/1750975259/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743639910","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3277320/850865/ec729432ddd8f9182c8a04b051950b47e